msgstr "Kopiëren naar klembord"

#: src/cam-settings.c
msgid ""
"The cameras are driven by <a href=\"https://libcamera.org/\">libcamera</a>, "
"under the GNU LGPL 2.1 or later."
msgstr ""
"De camera's worden aangestuurd door <a href=\"https://libcamera.org/"
"\">libcamera</a>, onder de GNU LGPL 2.1 of later."

